          "quote": "不跟老人说“快好了”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by the family’s repeated concern that swelling improvement, no immediate dialysis, or slight urine improvement might mean safety. The doctor distinguished symptom improvement from kidney/electrolyte stability, tied that correction to continued admission, lab monitoring, and medication restraint, and obtained family confirmation.",
