        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by blurry old reports and incomplete longitudinal history. The doctor asked targeted questions and queried the workspace, elicited prior creatinine trend, CKD stage, anemia/acidosis, medication uncertainty, and follow-up gaps, then used those facts to justify same-day renal/electrolyte evaluation while still requiring current labs.",
